    "text": "In string algorithms, finding the Longest Common Prefix (LCP) across N strings has four standard algorithmic paradigms. Method 1: Horizontal Scanning. LCP(S1...Sn) = LCP(LCP(LCP(S1, S2), S3)...Sn). If at any point the running prefix becomes empty, we break immediately.",
